<h1>Indexed Packs</h1>
<p class="subtitle">Small remote manifests and flat Markdown files, with important install boundaries.</p>

<h2 id="current-registry">Current public registry</h2>
<p>The checked-in <code>penumbraforge/mcp-librarian-skills</code> index currently lists {{ versions.librarian.packs }} packs and {{ versions.librarian.packSkills }} skills total. Every pack contains exactly one skill file.</p>

